 :0}"><span data-olk-copy-source="MessageBody">All Indiana University even
 ts\, groups\, activities\, and&#160\;educational\, cultural\, and histori
 cal observances welcome all IU students and other members of the Indiana 
 University community.</span></span></span></p><br /><strong>For more info
 rmation\, <a href="https://beinvolved.indiana.edu/event/12474518">view th
 is event in BeInvolved</a>.</strong>
